"Drathok's hold over Markus Brown is a facsimile, not a true Soul Contract."
"Markus can speak of his contract, and Drathok cannot sense him trying to break it."
"Drathok is bound to the demon Elasar by a true Soul Contract, so he cannot attack Elasar."
